# acc.script -- DESK43 U9-5: open the first desk accessory from the Desk menu with the mouse: pointer to the
# top-left corner, to the Desk title (20,9), down 50 px to item 3 (y 59 = 19 + 2*16 + 8: "Desktop info...",
# separator, first accessory), left click (AC_OPEN). Return 4 s later (closes the accessory's alert/dialog, if any).
200 0xF8 0x80 0x80 0xF8 0x80 0x80 0xF8 0x80 0x80 0xF8 0x80 0x80
210 0xF8 0x14 0x09
300 0xF8 0x00 0x32
500 0xFA 0x00 0x00
510 0xF8 0x00 0x00
1300 0x1C
1310 0x9C
